Third-party and vendored components
-----------------------------------

firmware/vendor/smack_core.c and firmware/vendor/smack_core.h are vendored
from smack (https://github.com/timncox/schwung-smack), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Tim Cox.

firmware/vendor/plugin_api_v1.h is vendored from schwung
(https://github.com/charlesvestal/schwung), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Charles Vestal.

Building this firmware requires libDaisy and the STM32 HAL
(https://github.com/electro-smith/libDaisy), MIT License, Copyright (c)
Electrosmith. libDaisy is a build dependency and is not redistributed here.

Faceplate geometry
------------------

The control positions in faceplate/geometry.py are mechanical measurements of
Noise Engineering Versio hardware, derived from the 1:1 print template
published in the FRGMNTS Versio manual by Acidclank. No artwork from that
manual is reproduced -- the overlay generated by this repository is original
work, and only coordinates were extracted.

That template carries its own restriction against using its data to
manufacture or sell panels commercially. If you intend to produce panels for
sale, measure your own hardware instead of relying on these coordinates. See
faceplate/geometry.py for the derivation and faceplate/MEASURE.md for how to
replace it with your own measurements.

